          "message": "refactor: migrate color module to Typescript (#14717)\n\nThis PR converts our `color.js` module to Typescript, adding appropriate types along the way. This continues !14508's scoped approach to tightening our frontend type-checks, in line with @JakobDev's assessment in https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/5859#issuecomment-2560264.\n\nLike the `fetch` component in !14705, adding these types altered enough lines that Git doesn't see this as a file rename, sadly, which would affect the blame readout.\n\nReviewed-on: https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/14717\nReviewed-by: Gusted <redacted@example.invalid>\n",
